    "Original result bytes are unchanged. Archives normalize tar metadata and omit directory entries; source bytes are unchanged.",
    "Baseline guest image digests were not retained. Budget and skip cohorts record kernel, initramfs and init binary hashes; runtime admission is root-recorded, not independently attested.",
